e post</span></span></span></div><div class="editor-body" data-agent-element="post-body" data-agent-role="field" data-agent-label="The post's rich-text body content"><div><div contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Content" translate="no" class="tiptap ProseMirror" tabindex="0"><h1 data-post-title="">Hello world</h1><p>Body text here</p></div><div style="pointer-events: none; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; z-index: 10;"><div class="drag-handle" style="visibility: hidden; position: absolute; pointer-events: auto;" data-dragging="false" draggable="true"><div class="editor-drag-handle" title="Drag to reorder" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="6" cy="4" r="1.3"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="1.3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="9" r="1.3"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="1.3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="14" r="1.3"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="1.3"></circle></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="content-analysis">p1</div><div data-testid="term-picker">post/p1</div><dialog class="confirm-dialog" aria-labelledby="ID2"><h2 id="ID2">Nothing changed</h2><div class="confirm-dialog-body"><p>Nothing has changed since the last save. Save anyway?</p></div><div class="confirm-dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-agent-element="post-save-unchanged-confirm-cancel" data-agent-role="button" data-agent-label="Cancel — leaves &quot;Nothing changed&quot; unconfirmed; no action taken" data-jini-part="confirm.cancel" aria-busy="false" data-jini-state="ready">Cancel</button><button type="button" data-agent-element="post-save-unchanged-confirm-confirm" data-agent-role="button" data-agent-label="Save anyway — Nothing changed" data-jini-part="confirm.confirm" aria-busy="false" data-jini-state="ready">Save anyway</button></div></dialog><dialog class="confirm-dialog" aria-labelledby="ID3"><h2 id="ID3">Move to trash?</h2><div class="confirm-dialog-body"><p>Move this post ("Hello world") to trash? It will disappear from the site and from the posts list.</p></div><div class="confirm-dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-agent-element="post-delete-confirm-cancel" data-agent-role="button" data-agent-label="Cancel — leaves &quot;Move to trash?&quot; unconfirmed; no action taken" data-jini-part="confirm.cancel" aria-busy="false" data-jini-state="ready">Cancel</button><button type="button" class="btn-danger" data-agent-element="post-delete-confirm-confirm" data-agent-role="button" data-agent-label="Move to trash — Move to trash?; cannot be undone" data-jini-part="confirm.confirm" aria-busy="false" data-jini-state="ready">Move to trash</button></div></dialog></div>"`;

